==============================================================================
Input          : /pscratch/sd/j/jackm/sandbox_v2_docs_consolidation_2026-08-14/tmp/worktrees/wt_bisp_prof_s_codex_20260906/runs/Si/100_bisp_parent_route_2026-09-05/prof_s/15_P_cohsex_final/cohsex.in
Method         : cohsex / one_shot_dft
Photon route   : incumbent charge-screened W + Sigma^B (gw.sigma_x_bispinor) with the scalar band-diagonal q->0 head -- sys_dim = 3 (the packed bare route wants sys_dim = 2)
Photon head    : DEBUG: no Gamma-cell head at all (head_correction=off on the incumbent route); NOT a production calculation
  [config provenance] mpa_sampling_alpha = 1 (default for nonmetal)
[config provenance] linalg = local (deck)
linalg = local: fastest, but each task holds ceil(N_q_irr/P) complete N_mu x N_mu dense matrices (here ceil(8/4) x 480^2 x 16 B = 7.03 MiB per task, complex128) plus their factor workspace; on large systems where that is a large fraction of memory per task, set linalg = distributed
[config provenance] low_mem_bands = true (deck)
low_mem_bands = true: the two-face wavefunction carrier (band chunks of 16); required for the raw-parent (k_irr) route, which contracts G and the ISDF pair densities on the WFN's own k rows.  On an unreduced k grid the four-copy carrier (false) is faster when it fits.

CONFIGURATION PROVENANCE
------------------------
[config provenance] this deck names 1 LEGACY self-energy-axis key(s); they are honored, and the canonical axes resolved to compute_mode = cohsex, qp_solver = one_shot_dft.

PROCESSOR ARCHITECTURE
----------------------
MPI ranks      : 4
Accelerators   : 4 GPU devices (NVIDIA A100-SXM4-40GB, 1 per rank)
Processor mesh : 2 x 2  (centroid axes X x Y)
CPU allocation : 32 cores per rank
Host threads   : OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=16 (auto: physical cores of the affinity mask; applied to libscipy_openblas64_-61654e39.so)

METHOD AND PHYSICAL PATHWAYS
----------------------------
Self-energy    : static screened exchange + Coulomb hole; one-shot full-matrix effective Hamiltonian; Sigma evaluated at E_DFT with QSGW Hermitian symmetrization (distinct from fixed-DFT-state diagonal G0W0)
QP consistency  : one_shot_dft | other options: fixed_point (diagonal on-shell), self_consistent (rebuild G/W/Sigma)
EQP2 treatment  : off (set write_eqp2=true for fixed-Sigma eigenvalue self-consistency)
Screening      : RPA Dyson series; minimax imaginary-axis quadrature
Long wavelength: head=off; source=s_tensor
Coulomb system : 3D bulk; Hartree=live G-space
Spin channels  : charge + transverse current (bispinor)
Degenerate sets: averaged at 1.36057e-05 eV
ISDF state     : fresh fit requested

NUMERICAL ENVIRONMENT
---------------------
JAX/JAXLIB     : 0.9.1 / 0.9.1 | FP64 / complex128 | NCCL collectives
Wavefunctions  : phdf5 reader
Dense linalg   : local layout
LORRAX_BANDS_GEMM_FFI      = NATIVE : right-GEMM contraction forming G(tau) (native XLA dot lowering)
LORRAX_FFT_FFI             = ON     : flat-k FFTs for ISDF, chi0 and Sigma (cuFFT flat-k FFI)
LORRAX_FFT_FFI_FUSED       = ON     : fused tau-domain convolution (cuFFT fused-convolution FFI)
LORRAX_CONV_KPAIR_FFI      = ON     : pair-density convolution forming V(q) (cuFFT pair-convolution FFI)

